  data:
    Id: entangling
    DisplayName: Entangling
    Description: 'A lucky strike tangles the target in root and vine. Elemental family:
      Nature, the root-proc half -- Sylvan carries the on-hit damage and Thornhide
      carries the resistance; this used to ride along with both on one bundled Sylvan
      roll, now it is its own affix.'
